/* Native SDL / game-controller bridge for the explicitly supported Linux
 * PST:EE build. Loaded through Lua's package.loadlib from override/ by
 * M_PSTPAD.lua, so no launcher, injection or launch options are involved.
 *
 * The engine binary ships unstripped, so every function, global and vtable
 * resolves by symbol name through the table generated by inspect_linux.py
 * (linux_offsets.h). The full executable SHA-256 and both patch-site
 * prologues are verified before anything is bound or patched; any mismatch
 * refuses the load through the Lua error path.
 *
 * Two engine hooks are installed at load time, both restoring the original
 * instructions through trampolines: CChitin::ProcessEvents carries the
 * movie A-button skip and drops our marked Escape keys once playback ends,
 * and CVidMode::SetPointer is suppressed while the mod hides the cursor.
 * The Windows build's steering wait/face gates and destination-marker gate
 * are not ported yet; movement still routes through the stock group order
 * path.
 */
